    "nodes": {
      "71": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "BPM TO FREQUENCY\n\nThis node converts the BPM value to a frequency(Hz). This can be usefull to synchronize values to a beat that are not triggers.\nIn the example we take the BPM from the Transport Settings node and convert it to a frequency. We divide this by 4 to get the frequency to sync up with 1 bar. We use this value for the frequency of our Sine.\n\nThe result is that no matter the BPM speed, the animation will always be in sync with the Transport Beat below.\n\nPress play to start the example."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
